---

<section class="problemas-section">
  <div class="problemas-wrap">

    <!-- LEFT: imagen -->
    <div class="problemas-img-col">
      <img
        src="https://eficer.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/peru-softwres-control-patrimonial.png"
        alt="Software de control patrimonial Perú"
        loading="lazy"
        width="850"
        height="949"
        class="problemas-img"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT: pain cards -->
    <div class="eficer-pain-section">
      <div class="eficer-pain-wrap">

        <h2>¿Te pasa <span>esto?</span></h2>

        <div class="eficer-pain-grid">
          <div class="eficer-pain-card">
            <div class="eficer-pain-icon">!</div>
            <h3>Tienes observaciones en auditorías por inconsistencias</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="eficer-pain-card">
            <div class="eficer-pain-icon">✕</div>
            <h3>Tus activos están en Excel y no cuadran</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="eficer-pain-card">
            <div class="eficer-pain-icon">⚠</div>
            <h3>No sabes exactamente dónde están todos los bienes</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="eficer-pain-card">
            <div class="eficer-pain-icon">↻</div>
            <h3>Las depreciaciones se hacen manualmente (y con errores)</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.problemas-section {
  background: #04394C;
}

.problemas-wrap {
  max-width: 1160px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 600px;
}

/* ── IMAGE ── */
.problemas-img-col {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
  height: 100%;
  padding-top: 40px;
}
.problemas-img {
  max-width: 100%;
  max-height: 560px;
  object-fit: contain;
  display: block;
}

/* ── PAIN SECTION ── */
.eficer-pain-section {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  padding: 80px 20px 80px 40px;
  color: #fff;
}

.eficer-pain-wrap {
  text-align: center;
}

.eficer-pain-wrap h2 {
  margin: 0 0 38px;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 62px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  color: #fff;
}

.eficer-pain-wrap h2 span { color: #FF6A3D; }

.eficer-pain-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.eficer-pain-card {
  padding: 30px 22px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(20,30,45,.95), rgba(40,34,42,.85));
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,106,61,.25);
  box-shadow: 0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  transition: .25s ease;
}
.eficer-pain-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  border-color: rgba(255,106,61,.55);
  box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(255,106,61,.14);
}

.eficer-pain-icon {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  margin: 0 auto 18px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(255,106,61,.14);
  color: #FF6A3D;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.eficer-pain-card h3 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #fff;
}

/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .problemas-wrap {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    min-height: auto;
  }
  .problemas-img-col {
    padding: 40px 0 0;
    max-height: 320px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .eficer-pain-section { padding: 60px 20px; }
}

@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .problemas-wrap { max-width: 100%; padding: 0; }
  .problemas-img-col { display: none; }
  .eficer-pain-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .eficer-pain-section { padding: 40px 18px; }
  .eficer-pain-wrap h2 { font-size: 32px; }
}
</style>
